ward leads there: until you\'ve won you are ALWAYS making progress toward the next gym. Grinding/catching/detours are fine — but ONLY with a clear purpose, and then you GET BACK ON THE ROAD to Cinnabar Island. Never just circle the same grass. Word on the road about Blaine: the old fire scientist — FIRE-types on a volcano island; water washes him out YOUR STORY SO FAR (what you\'ve actually done — your past, not the future): Six badges: only Blaine on Cinnabar (Volcano) and Giovanni in Viridian (Earth) stand between you and the Elite Four road.. Next on my list: catch an growlithe around Route 7 / Route 8. It grows into my arcanine — that\'s my answer for Champion down the line. Grabbing it now, before I need it.. THINGS YOU\'VE HEARD AND READ (from people and signs — your own notes, use them when they point somewhere): "I had a vision of your arrival. I have had psychic powers since I was a child. It started when a spoon I carelessly tossed, bent. I dislike battling, but if you"; "Sealed within that TM06 lies TOXIC! It is a secret technique dating back some four hundred years."; "KIRA put the TM06 in the TM CASE."; "KIRA received TM06 from KOGA.". YOUR PLAN — right now: You\'re ready — stop grinding and head to Cinnabar Island for the Volcano Badge. Next: You CRUSHED Sabrina — ride the momentum: Blaine in Cinnabar Island is NEXT (not fought yet); the trainers on the way are your training. Bigger picture: Reach Cinnabar Island, beat Blaine for the Volcano Badge. Your team right now: blastoise (L57), rattata (L18), abra the kadabra (L19), diglett (L18), lapras (L25). Remember YOU are the one playing this — narrate your plan to chat in your own voice (first person: "I\'m grinding", "my team"), and never ask anyone what you\'re doing or who\'s on your team — you know.. HEADS UP — you just chose \'use_surf\' and NOTHING changed (same spot, no progress). Repeating it again will do the same nothing. Pick a DIFFERENT action this time and break the loop.', 'progress': "6 ba